@startuml
title As-Is Runtime Context - library-service

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
rectangle Browser
node "library-service\nSpring Boot MVC" as Library
database "PostgreSQL\nlib_checkout" as Postgres
collections "Thymeleaf Templates\nhome/book/member/loan" as Templates
collections "Static Resources\ncss/js" as Static
artifact "db/seed/demo-data-postgres.sql" as Seed

User --> Browser : open pages / submit forms
Browser --> Library : HTTP 8080
Library --> Templates : render views
Library --> Static : serve assets
Library --> Postgres : JPA / JDBC / Flyway
Library ..> Seed : execute once if\nbooks, members, loans are empty\n(docker-pg only)

note right of Library
Profiles:
- local-h2
- test
- docker-pg

Current UI:
- Home dashboard
- Books
- Members dashboard
- Loans
end note

@enduml
